{"id":"d4dc334a9ae04367","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-expcom-oracle-collapse.md","title":"EXPCOM预言机下P与NP的共同塌缩","display":"prop-expcom-oracle-collapse — EXPCOM预言机下P与NP的共同塌缩","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-expcom-oracle-collapse","aliases":["28-prop-expcom-oracle-collapse"],"display":"prop-expcom-oracle-collapse — EXPCOM预言机下P与NP的共同塌缩","depends_on":["[[28-df-expcom-oracle]]","[[28-df-oracle-class]]","[[28-df-exp]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Example 3.6(3) and proof","source_printed_pages":"74","source_pdf_pages":"100","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-expcom-oracle-collapse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-expcom-oracle-collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-expcom-oracle-collapse — EXPCOM预言机下P与NP的共同塌缩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"01678cd990532be9\" href=\"?note=01678cd990532be9\" title=\"28-df-expcom-oracle\">28-df-expcom-oracle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e2f71764c556aa9\" href=\"?note=5e2f71764c556aa9\" title=\"28-df-exp\">28-df-exp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Example 3.6(3) and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"74"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"100"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EXPCOM}\">\\(\\mathrm{EXPCOM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^B,\\mathbf{NP}^B\">\\(\\mathbf P^B,\\mathbf{NP}^B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{EXP}\">\\(\\mathbf{EXP}\\)</span> 见所列本地定义；询问串的写出长度计入预言机时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^{\\mathrm{EXPCOM}}=\\mathbf{NP}^{\\mathrm{EXPCOM}}=\\mathbf{EXP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P^{\\mathrm{EXPCOM}}=\\mathbf{NP}^{\\mathrm{EXPCOM}}=\\mathbf{EXP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>EXP机器的指数时钟可用多项式长的一元指数参数写成一次EXPCOM询问，得EXP⊆P<sup>EXPCOM。反向枚举NP预言机的多项式长猜测串；每次询问长度至多多项式，模拟其EXPCOM指数时钟仍只用2</sup>{poly(n)}时间，总查询数和猜测数也不超该界。故NP^EXPCOM⊆EXP，中间包含由忽略非确定性取得。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Example 3.6(3) and proof；印刷 pp.74 / PDF pp.100。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-expcom-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"01678cd990532be9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-expcom-oracle]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-class","status":"resolved","id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oracle-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-exp","status":"resolved","id":"5e2f71764c556aa9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-exp]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{EXPCOM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P^B,\\mathbf{NP}^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{EXP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P^{\\mathrm{EXPCOM}}=\\mathbf{NP}^{\\mathrm{EXPCOM}}=\\mathbf{EXP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1556,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-284","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-cor-np-neq-nexp]]、[[28-df-expcom-oracle]]、[[28-prop-expcom-oracle-collapse]]。"}],"outgoing":["01678cd990532be9","f4ae5e0b4d42d561","5e2f71764c556aa9"]}